.TH dalgona-dev-journal-diff 1  "dalgona-dev-journal-diff " 
.SH NAME
dalgona\-dev\-journal\-diff \- Print the folded fields that differ between two journals.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdalgona dev journal diff\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIBEFORE\fR> <\fIAFTER\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the folded fields that differ between two journals.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIBEFORE\fR>
The journal whose folded fields print as removed
.TP
<\fIAFTER\fR>
The journal whose folded fields print as added
